.915 4.928zM12.7 18.2h7.8v1h-7.8zM2.5 5.5h26.9v1.9H2.5z"/></svg></span></span><span class="nd-code-lang">bash</span></div><pre><code class="language-bash">brew install nginx</code></pre></div></div><div class="nd-tabs__bar"><label for="nd-tabs-1-1">Ubuntu</label><label for="nd-tabs-1-2">macOS</label></div></div><h2>提及与图片</h2><p>@nexusdown 是一个 Markdown 编辑器。</p><div class="nd-carousel"><ul class="nd-carousel__track"><li class="nd-carousel__slide" id="nd-c-1-1"><img src="/img-a.svg" alt="图一"/></li><li class="nd-carousel__slide" id="nd-c-1-2"><img src="/img-b.svg" alt="图二"/></li></ul><ol class="nd-carousel__dots"><li><a class="nd-carousel__dot" href="#nd-c-1-1" aria-label="第 1 张">1</a></li><li><a class="nd-carousel__dot" href="#nd-c-1-2" aria-label="第 2 张">2</a></li></ol></div>"
